  "summary": "注释提供《斗数论姻缘》的出处，解释传统破相延年及孤寡、孤克的用法。配偶六十岁前亡、三十岁后失尊亲与父母失子被区别讨论；作者强调年龄只是概数，须结合社会环境和平均寿命，不能固定套用。健康与寿命说法为传统命理观点。",
  "summary_en": "These notes cite Zi Yun on marriage and explain traditional beliefs about facial injury prolonging life and definitions of spousal or familial bereavement. Spousal death before sixty, loss of an elder after thirty, and parents outliving children are distinguished. Ages are approximate and depend on social conditions and average lifespan, not fixed thresholds. Health and longevity claims are attributed to traditional astrology, not medical facts.",
